     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">8TH EUROPEAN CONGRESS OF MATHEMATICS<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">5 - 11 July 2020, Portorož, Slovenia<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://www.8ecm.si/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.8ecm.si/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793236951419000&amp;usg=AOvVaw05izS-6Gd5MRAK4PmHXQDm\">https://www.8ecm.si/</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Deadline for 8ECM Scholarship applications is extended!<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Applicants have until 31 October, 2019 to submit their applications for the 8ECM Scholarship.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://8ecm.si/about-8ecm/8ecm-scholarships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://8ecm.si/about-8ecm/8ecm-scholarships&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793236951419000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2exGUn9LzJ7K5dS4ALWIcG\">https://8ecm.si/about-8ecm/8ecm-scholarships</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">LP,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p clas